+ * region -- nothing can be blessed after the debugger detaches -- so every code
+ * buffer necessarily shares it. Asserted below rather than assumed, because a
+ * second delta silently corrupting one of two code buffers is the kind of bug
+ * that would surface as an impossible crash much later.
